<title>UK: London Tea Auction price indications.</title>
<headline>London Tea Auction price indications.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>At today's London landed Tea Auction of 7,850 packages of 53.50 kgs, including 2,200 offshore, price indications in pence a kilo compared to the last sale and the corresponding week last year.</p>
<p>    Best available  183   (170 and 254)</p>
<p>    Good		132   (130 and 170)</p>
<p>    Good Medium     125   (123 and 128)</p>
<p>    Medium	    116   (114 and  98)</p>
<p>    Low Medium	unq   ( 90 and  85)</p>
<p>The highest price paid was 183 pence for a Rwanda PD.</p>
</text>
